{"id":"level-up-2026-10-22","name":"2026-10-22 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1701","en":"The innovative design allows the chair to fold completely flat.","zh":"这种创新设计使椅子可以完全折平。","note":"innovative · 革新的， 创新的， 新颖的； 富有革新精神的 · an innovative design","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1702","en":"She greeted the unexpected invitation with undisguised delight.","zh":"收到意外邀请时，她毫不掩饰自己的喜悦。","note":"undisguised · 无伪装的； 坦率的 · undisguised delight","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1703","en":"The diaries provide insight into daily life during the journey.","zh":"这些日记让人深入了解旅途中的日常生活。","note":"insight · 洞察力， 深刻的了解； 顿悟 · provide insight","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1704","en":"Local volunteers were instrumental in saving the village library.","zh":"当地志愿者在挽救村图书馆的过程中发挥了重要作用。","note":"instrumental · 有帮助的， 起作用的； 用乐器演奏的 · instrumental in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1705","en":"The map shows the exact location of the meeting point.","zh":"地图标明了集合地点的确切位置。","note":"exact · 精确的； 准确的 · the exact location","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1706","en":"The report examines rising unemployment in former industrial towns.","zh":"报告考察了昔日工业城镇不断上升的失业情况。","note":"unemployment · 失业； 失业人数 · rising unemployment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1707","en":"Heavy rain may force us to move the concert indoors.","zh":"大雨可能迫使我们把音乐会移到室内。","note":"force · 强迫 · force someone to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1708","en":"The greenhouse temperature rose above thirty degrees centigrade by noon.","zh":"到中午时，温室温度已经超过了三十摄氏度。","note":"centigrade · 百分度的； 摄氏度的 · degrees centigrade","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1709","en":"The fictional mayor dismisses the accusation as malicious slander.","zh":"小说中的市长把这项指控斥为恶意诽谤。","note":"slander · 诋毁，中伤，诽谤；诋毁， 诽谤 · malicious slander","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1710","en":"The map reveals an uneven distribution of parks across the city.","zh":"地图显示了公园在全市分布不均。","note":"distribution · 分发， 分配； 配给物； 散布， 分布 · uneven distribution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1711","en":"Her sedentary work involves spending most mornings at a desk.","zh":"她的工作需要久坐，多数上午都在书桌前度过。","note":"sedentary · 需要久坐的； 惯于久坐不动的； 定居的， 不迁徙的； 沉积的 · sedentary work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1712","en":"The hall has a seating capacity of two hundred.","zh":"这间大厅可以容纳两百人就座。","note":"capacity · 容量， 容积； 能量， 能力 · seating capacity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1713","en":"The small kitchen struggled to cope with the weekend crowds.","zh":"小厨房很难应付周末的大批客人。","note":"cope · 应付； 处理 · cope with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1714","en":"The evidence led us towards an uncomfortable but inescapable conclusion.","zh":"证据使我们得出了一个令人不安却无法回避的结论。","note":"inescapable · 不可逃避的； 难免的 · an inescapable conclusion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1715","en":"A complete transcript of the interview appears in the appendix.","zh":"访谈的完整文字记录收录在附录中。","note":"transcript · 抄本， 副本； 文字记录 · a complete transcript","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1716","en":"Days of heavy rain can saturate the soil around the foundations.","zh":"连日大雨可能使地基周围的土壤完全湿透。","note":"saturate · 使湿透， 浸透； 使充满， 使饱和 · saturate the soil","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1717","en":"I enrolled in an evening course on basic photography.","zh":"我报名参加了一门基础摄影夜校课程。","note":"course · 追猎； 运行； 流动；过程，进程；路线，方针；跑道；课程 · an evening course","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1718","en":"Bring a waterproof jacket in case the weather changes.","zh":"带上一件防水外套，以防天气变化。","note":"waterproof · 不透水的； 防水的 · a waterproof jacket","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1719","en":"A rectangular table fits neatly against the narrow kitchen wall.","zh":"一张长方形桌子正好靠着狭窄的厨房墙壁摆放。","note":"rectangular · 长方形的， 矩形的 · a rectangular table","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1720","en":"In addition to lectures, the course includes weekly field trips.","zh":"除讲座外，这门课程还包括每周的实地考察。","note":"in addition · 另外，此外 · in addition to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1721","en":"Precise measurements are essential when fitting shelves into this alcove.","zh":"在这个壁凹里安装架子时，精确测量非常重要。","note":"precise · 精确的， 准确的； 严谨的 · precise measurements","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1722","en":"Taking the earlier train seemed a sensible decision.","zh":"乘坐更早一班火车似乎是个明智的决定。","note":"sensible · 明智的； 合情理的； 能觉察到的 · a sensible decision","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1723","en":"She wondered whether his sudden generosity concealed an ulterior motive.","zh":"她怀疑他突然变得慷慨是否隐藏着不可告人的动机。","note":"ulterior · 较远的； 不可告人的， 隐秘的， 秘密的 · an ulterior motive","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1724","en":"The industrious student spent her evenings practising difficult violin passages.","zh":"这个勤奋的学生把晚上的时间用来练习高难度小提琴乐段。","note":"industrious · 勤奋的， 勤勉的， 勤劳的 · an industrious student","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1725","en":"I suspect a mistake in the final column of figures.","zh":"我怀疑最后一列数字里有一个错误。","note":"suspect · 猜想， 怀疑 · suspect a mistake","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1726","en":"Even the office workaholic took a break during the holiday.","zh":"连办公室里的工作狂都在假日期间休息了一下。","note":"workaholic · 工作狂 · a dedicated workaholic","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1727","en":"All participants must abide by the competition's published rules.","zh":"所有参与者都必须遵守比赛公布的规则。","note":"abide · 停留， 逗留； 容忍， 忍受 · abide by","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1728","en":"They managed to contrive a temporary solution using spare parts.","zh":"他们设法用备用零件想出了临时解决办法。","note":"contrive · 计划， 图谋； 设计； 发明 · contrive a solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1729","en":"The festival brought a massive increase in visitors to the town.","zh":"这个节庆活动使小镇游客数量大幅增加。","note":"massive · 大而重的， 厚实的， 粗大的； 大量的， 大规模的 · a massive increase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1730","en":"Guests could mingle with the artists after the performance.","zh":"演出结束后，来宾可以与艺术家们交流。","note":"mingle · 混合， 联结； 相往来； 混杂其中 · mingle with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1731","en":"The café decorated its cakes with colourful edible flowers.","zh":"这家咖啡馆用色彩鲜艳的食用花装饰蛋糕。","note":"edible · 可食用的 · edible flowers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1732","en":"By the final verse, everyone could sing the chorus.","zh":"唱到最后一节时，所有人都会唱副歌了。","note":"chorus · 齐声说；合唱，合唱曲；合唱队；副歌，叠句；齐声，齐声说的话 · sing the chorus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1733","en":"I owe you an apology for missing our meeting.","zh":"我缺席了我们的会面，应该向你道歉。","note":"owe · 欠； 把…归功于 · owe an apology","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1734","en":"Her ability to listen is a valuable asset to the team.","zh":"她善于倾听的能力是团队的一项宝贵优势。","note":"asset · 财产； 优点 · a valuable asset","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1735","en":"There is a minimum charge for using the recording studio.","zh":"使用录音室设有最低收费。","note":"minimum · 最低的， 最小的；最小值，最低限度 · a minimum charge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1736","en":"The magician taught the children a simple magic trick.","zh":"魔术师教孩子们表演了一个简单的魔术。","note":"magic · 有魔力的， 神奇的；魔法，法术；魅力，魔力 · a magic trick","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1737","en":"The unyielding stone floor made sleeping in the shelter uncomfortable.","zh":"石地板坚硬，睡在这个避难所里很不舒服。","note":"unyielding · 顽强的； 坚硬的； 不能弯曲的， 坚固的 · an unyielding surface","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1738","en":"Comparing the records may reveal a pattern we previously missed.","zh":"比较这些记录，可能会揭示我们之前忽略的规律。","note":"reveal · 揭露； 泄露； 展现 · reveal a pattern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1739","en":"Students collect data on traffic outside the school each morning.","zh":"学生每天早上收集学校外的交通数据。","note":"data · 数据； 资料 · collect data","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1740","en":"The researchers developed a theoretical model before testing their predictions.","zh":"研究人员先建立了理论模型，然后检验预测。","note":"theoretical · 理论的 · a theoretical model","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1741","en":"We stayed in a youth hostel near the harbour.","zh":"我们住在港口附近的一家青年旅舍。","note":"hostel · 招待所； 学生宿舍 · a youth hostel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1742","en":"A barn owl flew silently across the field at dusk.","zh":"黄昏时，一只仓鸮无声地飞过田野。","note":"owl · 猫头鹰 · a barn owl","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1743","en":"Our hospitable hosts prepared breakfast before showing us the village.","zh":"热情好客的主人准备好早餐，然后带我们参观村庄。","note":"hospitable · 好客的， 殷勤的， 热情友好的； 宜人的； 易接受的， 开通的 · hospitable hosts","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1744","en":"The drummer began to beat a drum as the parade approached.","zh":"游行队伍接近时，鼓手开始击鼓。","note":"drum · 鼓， 鼓状物 · beat a drum","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1745","en":"The window began to vibrate as the heavy truck passed.","zh":"重型卡车经过时，窗户开始震动。","note":"vibrate · 颤动 · vibrate gently","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1746","en":"A cork stopper kept the contents of the bottle secure.","zh":"软木塞将瓶内的东西封好。","note":"cork · 软木塞；用软木塞塞住 · a cork stopper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1747","en":"Could you translate these instructions into French for our visitors?","zh":"你能把这些说明翻译成法语，供我们的访客使用吗？","note":"translate · 翻译 · translate into","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-22:s1748","en":"The award provid